<view class="page"><view class="me-heading"><view class="seal serif">记</view><view class="title">这棵树，只属于你。</view><view class="subtitle">不必向谁展示，也值得认真收藏。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{needsConsent}}" class="card"><button class="primary" bindtap="begin">开始使用</button></view><view class="stats"><view><text class="stat-num">{{count}}</text><view>个瞬间</view></view><view><text class="stat-num">{{preciousCount}}</text><view>个珍贵记忆</view></view></view><view class="card"><button class="menu-row" bindtap="export" disabled="{{busy || needsConsent}}"><text>{{exportFile ? '② 发送文件给好友（内容已复制）' : '导出文字记录'}}</text><text>›</text></button><button class="menu-row" bindtap="import" disabled="{{busy}}"><text>导入文字备份</text><text>›</text></button><button class="menu-row" bindtap="letter"><text>重读那封信</text><text>›</text></button><button class="menu-row" bindtap="privacy"><text>隐私与数据说明</text><text>›</text></button><button class="menu-row" bindtap="cleanup" disabled="{{busy || needsConsent}}"><text>重试已删除照片的清理</text><text>›</text></button><button class="menu-row danger" bindtap="clear" disabled="{{busy || needsConsent}}"><text>清空记录并停止使用</text><text>›</text></button></view><view class="note center export-note"><view>导出的 JSON 包含文字与日期，不含照片。</view><view>重要照片请在记忆详情中预览并另行保存。</view></view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="empty">正在处理，请保持页面打开…</view><view class="note center">人生记忆树 1.0.0</view><view wx:if="{{filingNumber}}" class="note center">{{filingNumber}}</view></view><first-letter open="{{letterOpen}}" bind:close="onLetterClose"/><privacy-consent id="privacy"/>
